  "description": "Reid Comfort 2 ST | Step-through comfort bike\nComfortable, relaxed and easy to ride – the Reid Bikes Comfort 2 ST is a versatile step-through bike designed for everyday cycling, leisurely rides and exploring different routes.\nBuilt around a lightweight alloy frame, the Comfort 2 ST features a step-through design that makes getting on and off the bike easier. Its relaxed geometry encourages a more upright riding position, helping reduce strain and making it a comfortable choice for casual cycling.\nAn 80mm Zoom suspension fork helps absorb bumps and vibrations from uneven surfaces, while the 27.5-inch double-wall alloy wheels and 2.35-inch all-terrain tyres provide stability and grip across a variety of riding conditions.\nThe Shimano 21-speed Tourney drivetrain offers a wide range of gears for tackling gentle climbs and flatter routes. Shimano Revoshift twist shifters make changing gears straightforward, while lightweight alloy V-brakes provide reliable and controlled stopping power.\nFinished with an adjustable alloy stem, ergonomic handlebars, comfortable grips and a supportive saddle, the Reid Bikes Comfort 2 ST is designed to make everyday riding more enjoyable.\nThe Reid Bikes Comfort 2 ST is ideal for:\n\nEasy mounting and dismounting, with a step-through frame design\n\nComfortable everyday cycling, with relaxed geometry and an upright riding position\n\nLeisurely rides, with ergonomic grips and a supportive comfort saddle\n\nVaried routes, with Shimano 21-speed gearing for a range of gradients\n\nSmoother riding, with an 80mm suspension fork to help absorb bumps\n\nStability and grip, with 27.5-inch wheels and 2.35-inch all-terrain tyres",
